{"ticker":"FOXA","updated":"2026-10-23T23:00:14Z","profile":{"longName":"Fox Corporation","shortName":"Fox Corporation","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Entertainment","country":"United States","website":"https://www.foxcorporation.com","fullTimeEmployees":10550,"marketCap":28083464192,"trailingPE":17.34375,"forwardPE":11.367379,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.6398146,"pegRatio":1.22,"targetMeanPrice":79.62833,"targetHighPrice":125.0,"targetLowPrice":60.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":18,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.281,"earningsGrowth":0.031,"grossMargins":0.36629,"operatingMargins":0.25214002,"profitMargins":0.09839,"totalRevenue":17125999616,"beta":0.613,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":76.39,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":48.34,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.85},"summary":"Fox Corporation operates as a news, sports, and entertainment company in the United States. It operates in two segments, Cable Network Programming and Television. The Cable Network Programming segment produces and licenses news and sports content for distribution through traditional cable television systems, direct broadcast satellite operators, telecommunication companies, virtual multi-channel video programming distributors, and other digital platforms. The Television segment produces, acquires, markets, and distributes programming through the FOX broadcast network; advertising-supported video-on-demand service Tubi; and operates full power broadcast television stations, including duopolies and other digital platforms. This segment also produces content for third parties. It also engages in the consumer finance marketplace; and provision of television and film production services along with office space, studio operation services, and all operations of the facility. Fox Corporation was incorporated in 2018 and is headquartered in New York, New York.","summary_zh":"福克斯公司在美國經營一家新聞、體育和娛樂公司。它分為兩個部門：有線電視網路節目和電視部門。有線電視節目部門製作並授權新聞和體育內容，以便透過傳統有線電視系統、直播衛星營運商、電信公司、虛擬多頻道視訊節目發行商和其他數位平台進行分發。電視部門透過福斯廣播網路製作、取得、行銷和分發節目；廣告支援的視訊點播服務 Tubi；並經營全權廣播電視台，包括雙寡頭和其他數位平台。該部門也為第三方製作內容。它還涉足消費金融市場；提供電視和電影製作服務以及辦公空間、工作室運營服務以及設施的所有運營。 Fox Corporation 成立於 2018 年，總部位於紐約州紐約市。","sector_zh":"通訊服務","industry_zh":"娛樂","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":59.21,"h":59.91,"l":58.98,"c":59.77,"v":2526200},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":59.81,"h":59.94,"l":58.695,"c":59.07,"v":3494400},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":58.94,"h":59.55,"l":58.89,"c":59.52,"v":2129000},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":59.57,"h":59.57,"l":59.06,"c":59.46,"v":1775500},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":59.56,"h":59.995,"l":59.325,"c":59.7,"v":2455300},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":59.38,"h":61.1,"l":59.194,"c":61.05,"v":3470700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":60.72,"h":61.28,"l":59.95,"c":60.08,"v":2506900},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":60.53,"h":60.87,"l":59.965,"c":60.81,"v":3028700},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":60.55,"h":61.515,"l":60.485,"c":61.5,"v":2103700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":61.41,"h":62.69,"l":61.1,"c":62.48,"v":2066000},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":59.652,"h":59.82,"l":57.72,"c":58.64,"v":6434800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":58.34,"h":58.34,"l":55.67,"c":57.19,"v":6682000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":57.1,"h":59.03,"l":56.87,"c":58.73,"v":5408500},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":58.26,"h":59.13,"l":57.85,"c":58.25,"v":3542600},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":58.15,"h":58.93,"l":57.82,"c":58.77,"v":4956100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":58.61,"h":58.77,"l":57.44,"c":57.47,"v":4168200},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":57.64,"h":59.74,"l":57.64,"c":59.22,"v":4669000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":59.23,"h":60.51,"l":59.2,"c":59.84,"v":4296000},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":59.76,"h":61.11,"l":59.63,"c":60.62,"v":9054500},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":62.4,"h":62.48,"l":60.73,"c":62.42,"v":5934300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":62.37,"h":62.85,"l":61.58,"c":61.61,"v":3610500},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":61.49,"h":61.67,"l":60.005,"c":60.16,"v":3920900},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":59.93,"h":61.04,"l":59.79,"c":60.23,"v":4171000},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":60.67,"h":61.38,"l":60.57,"c":61.15,"v":3308400},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":61.51,"h":62.97,"l":60.89,"c"